UNITREE GO2 ROBOT MODEL
=======================

The visualization example can display the Unitree Go2 URDF and Collada meshes
packaged by go2_ros2_sdk (https://github.com/abizovnuralem/go2_ros2_sdk).

Those files are NOT redistributed in this repository or in the built
distribution. They are downloaded on demand, at the user's request, into a
local cache directory. This is deliberate policy, not an implementation
detail: it keeps third-party artwork out of this repository and out of the
wheel. Do not vendor them.
